Quick reminder everybody

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:50.810 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
to subscribe to
our YouTube channel

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.345 line:0%
and click that notification bell

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:55.248 line:0%
so that you maybe just maybe

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.517 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
actually see our
videos in your feed.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:58.751
