00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:55.161 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean that, all right,
so what prompted?

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:56.362
Why did you get the beard?

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.664 align:start size:81% position:19%
- I go off the
grid every August.

00:04:57.664 --> 00:05:01.601
