00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.772
And the first time I did it,

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.240
I just decided not to shave.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
I came back, everybody
said they loved the beard.

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:11.377
And then it took over
like black Spiderman.

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:15.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you're also a video
comic book guy, yeah.

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:18.318 align:start size:97% position:3%
- So actually my beard
story is very much the same.

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:19.352
It was Thanksgiving.

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:20.553
I mean, holidays, I never shave.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.688 align:start size:81% position:19%
And so I would
always try to grow

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:23.456 align:start size:88% position:13%
