00:07:04.023 --> 00:07:06.025
She's the anchor of the family.

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:08.361
She keeps everyone together.

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:12.131
She gets Homer to be a good dad.

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:16.202 align:start size:97% position:3%
Marge is the one that
there's the fewest edition,

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:17.036
but it,

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:22.642 align:start size:88% position:13%
the left hates when
anything in pop culture,

00:07:22.642 --> 00:07:24.644
